ontinue to make vital contributions to US technology competitiveness through leadership in optical innovation, strategic partnerships with hyperscalers, and contribution to domestic AI infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/12/lumentum-lite-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LITE 2025 Q4","e":"lite","d":"2025-08-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Michael Hurlston","x":"And my follow-up was really on sort of any thoughts you have on the semiconductor tariffs or section 232 investigation, whatever you want to call it, and in relation to sort of speculation around 100% tariffs on semiconductors given your fabs in Japan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/12/lumentum-lite-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LITE 2025 Q4","e":"lite","d":"2025-08-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Michael Hurlston","x":"And I did see you made an announcement of additional here in the US advanced optics, and how you're thinking about the likelihood of being exempted from any potential tariffs on the semiconductor side given your location of fabs?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/12/lumentum-lite-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LITE 2025 Q4","e":"lite","d":"2025-08-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Hurlston","x":"Despite the revenue decline in industrial tech, segment profitability improved primarily due to cost reduction initiatives we announced a quarter ago.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/12/lumentum-lite-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LITE 2026 Q2","e":"lite","d":"2026-02-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Wajid Ali","x":"While continuing to invest in critical R&D programs serving cloud and AI customers, we have maintained the rigorous cost controls necessary to optimize our business model.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/03/lumentum-lite-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LITE 2026 Q2","e":"lite","d":"2026-02-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael Hurlston","x":"In that, you've raised prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/03/lumentum-lite-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LITE 2026 Q2","e":"lite","d":"2026-02-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael Hurlston","x":"Is there any way you can help us quantify what impact your price increases have had on the growth?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/03/lumentum-lite-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LITE 2026 Q3","e":"lite","d":"2026-05-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Michael E. Hurlston","x":"While continuing to invest in critical R&D programs serving cloud and AI customers, we have maintained the rigorous cost controls necessary to optimize our business model.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/lumentum-lite-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LITE 2026 Q3","e":"lite","d":"2026-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael E. Hurlston","x":"And then, of course, there is price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/lumentum-lite-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LITE 2026 Q3","e":"lite","d":"2026-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael E. Hurlston","x":"And so we are talking to the major customers around trying to help, right, and put some skin in the game around the CapEx that we're going to try to lay out, one, that can entail prepayment, that can entail take-or-pay, that can entail price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/lumentum-lite-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LITE 2026 Q4","e":"lite","d":"2026-08-11","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Michael E. Hurlston","x":"As AI compute workloads increased in both speed and bandwidth, data center architects are turning to optical links as a primary means of connectivity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/18/lumentum-lite-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LITE 2026 Q4","e":"lite","d":"2026-08-11","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Michael E. Hurlston","x":"To put this in perspective, for one major hyperscaler, the network capacity connecting just 2 AI data center sites could double the total global backbone capacity they built over the entirety of the last decade.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/18/lumentum-lite-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LITE 2027 Q1","e":"lite","d":"2026-11-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Matt Murphy","x":"Zooming out, we expect the combined company to become one of the top five largest AI infrastructure semiconductor companies.","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1633978/000119312526443876/d178787d425.htm"},{"c":"LITE 2027 Q1","e":"lite","d":"2026-11-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Matt Murphy","x":"We believe that, after the transaction closes, the combined enterprise will be extremely well-positioned to solve some of the most critical challenges in the AI data infrastructure industry, a market that we believe represents one of the most significant technology investment opportunities.","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1633978/000119312526443876/d178787d425.htm"}],"trends":{"theater":[[62,1,8527,0,0,0,6762,1308],[64,1,8434,0,0,0,6156,1732],[65,1,7803,0,0,0,5946,1238],[66,1,8226,0,0,0,6149,1725],[67,1,10916,0,0,0,9521,1026]],"cinema":[[62,1,8527,0,0,0,6762,1308],[64,1,8434,0,0,0,6156,1732],[65,1,7803,0,0,0,5946,1238],[66,1,8226,0,0,0,6149,1725],[67,1,10916,0,0,0,9521,1026]],"imax":[[62,1,8527,0,0,0,6762,1308],[64,1,8434,0,0,0,6156,1732],[65,1,7803,0,0,0,5946,1238],[66,1,8226,0,0,0,6149,1725],[67,1,10916,0,0,0,9521,1026]],"streaming":[[62,1,8527,0,0,0,6762,1308],[64,1,8434,0,0,0,6156,1732],[65,1,7803,0,0,0,5946,1238],[66,1,8226,0,0,0,6149,1725],[67,1,10916,0,0,0,9521,1026]],"dtc":